# Student data must never be committed (this repo is published on GitHub Pages).
# The app has no legitimate .json, .csv or .eml files, so ignore them all:
# backups ("Gradebook backup …json"), automatic copies, Brightspace imports/exports,
# spreadsheet copies ("… grades ….csv"), and email drafts.
*.json
*.csv
*.tsv
*.txt
*.eml
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.pdf

# OS and editor clutter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local Claude Code state
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/.cc-writes/
